                            </div>

                            <p class="span">For a complete and famous website, it is necessary to make your website updated in every possible way. <a href="https://www.kingofdigitalmarketing.com/blog/youtube-marketing-helps-businesses-in-improving-conversions.aspx">Video marketing</a> is one of them, it is as valuable as your search engine optimization. We know that the content of a website is always made a preference but for the traffic, you need creative ideas such as video marketing. To add video to your content or website is a digital marketing strategy that is as important as search engine optimisation (SEO)  so everyone is aware of your brand or website. From a perspective of a visitor, one can easily watch the video for what all about the website is. So, it is important to add a video to your website. Trends show that the website that are having videos are having relatively more traffic than those that are not having. So, these are the reasons why you should add a video to your website.</p>

                            <h3 class="text-transf" id="1">Why Should You Use Video On Your Website?</h3>
                            
                            <p class="span">Video is the simplest form of communication by which you can clarify to the user what you want to say. So as a marketing strategy, you can take advantage of this amazing opportunity to present your video to your website and make it a leading website. Customers can connect to you and your website as it is human nature to engage more in videos than reading. After viewing a video, one can make ideas in his mind about how this particular website work as your company effectively communicates to the customers. Your videos should contain instructional information, products and services, business introduction and customers testimonials to look worthy to watch.</p>

                            <a href="#"><img src="images/Why Should You Use Video On Your Website.webp" class="img-responsive" alt="Why Should You Use Video On Your Website" /></a><br>

                            <h5>Statistics On Internet Video Consumption</h5>

                            <p class="span">
                                <ol class="bullet-list-css">
                                    <li>Video consumption has grown 32% annually and will also grow in the coming years</li>
                                    <li>We see that an average person usually watches up to or more than 100 minutes in a day</li>
                                    <li>More than 2 billion active users monthly, across the world on youtube. </li>
                                </ol>
                            </p>

                            <h5>Reasons Why You Should Have A Video On Your Website</h5>

                            <p class="span">
                                For adding a video, there are several reasons
                                <ol class="bullet-list-css">
                                    <li>On the search engine page, your rank will improve when you added the video as your website have something odd with proper keywords.</li>
                                    <li>You can easily reach the customers to show up your brand, company performance, company personality and product services. </li>
                                    <li>It can build trust between the customer and the company which shows the company's experience that how they deal with customer</li>
                                    <li>By adding video, your company can stand out from your competition with just one simple step.</li>
                                </ol>
                            </p>

                            <h3 class="text-transf" id="2">Importance Of Digital Marketing Services</h3>
                            
                            <p class="span">Digital Marketing mainly enables more traffic that is new to your website and generates leads, and sales of your product and service by connecting the people who are looking for your business's products. In a general language, we can say that it is a process of your business to market your product and services online and digitally by which high-value consumers can come. Hire the best <a href="https://www.kingofdigitalmarketing.com/">digital marketing company in Delhi</a> as they are very responsible for the work that they provide. Like, they always use proper keywords with high search volume, high-quality content and strategies to ensure more traffic to one's company website and rank them on the search engines. They help their clients to reach their business objectives. They all guide you so that your website or your content will rank higher and <a href="https://www.kingofdigitalmarketing.com/blog/improve-visibility-on-google.aspx">improve visibility on Google</a>. By which your website visibility and traffic will increase as the companies provide their client with the strategies and precise planning for their website.</p>

                            <a href="#"><img src="images/website with video.webp" class="img-responsive" alt="website with video" /></a><br>

                            <h3 class="text-transf" id="3">Website Designing For Your Website</h3>
                            
                            <p class="span">In a website design company, there is a web designer whose responsibility is to test and improve the design of the website. We know that the first impression always makes an impact on the client either good or bad. So it is important to make good web design. And when we talk about the <a href="https://www.kingofdigitalmarketing.com/Website-Development.aspx">website design company in Delhi</a>, they are leading. Their main work is to maintain the proper appearance and formation of the websites. They also have to check the standards of the content so that they can do their work correctly. They design visual images for the website for a client and keep in mind that they are in line with the business for all the clients. This is also one kind of marketing heck to rank your website on the Google search engine.</p>
            
